bidding_conventions/jacoby_transfers.summary:
Over partner's 1NT, 2♦ shows five or more hearts and 2♥ five or more spades;
opener bids the next suit, so the strong hand declares. Texas does the same
at the four level (4♦ for hearts, 4♥ for spades) with game values.

competitive_bidding/michaels_unusual.summary:
Two-suited overcalls. A cue bid of their suit shows five-five in two other
suits (over a minor, the majors; over a major, the other major and a minor);
a jump to 2NT shows the two lowest unbid suits.
